  "outcome": "action_taken",
  "severity": "routine",
  "summary": "The lounge spotlight and ceiling repair was approved at £198.37 + VAT. The contractor reports it done but has invoiced £277.72 + VAT (£333.26 inc VAT), 40% over the approval. I recorded the quote and invoice, held the payment (HOLD-102), asked the landlord to approve or reject the increase (APR-103), and asked the contractor for photos and a breakdown. The ticket is on hold until 2025-10-15.",
