    {
      "question": "1. Where does this case stand right now, and what is outstanding?",
      "answer": "The quote of £198.37 + VAT was approved on 28 Sep 2025. Contractor Clarke reports the work done on 8 Oct 2025 and has invoiced £277.72 + VAT (£333.26 inc VAT). That is 40% over the approval, so payment is on hold. Outstanding: landlord decision on the overrun, contractor photos and breakdown, invoice payment, and job closure. The property is void, so no tenant contact is needed."
    },
